sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">발생하고 있어&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.7pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -14.7pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -14.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt;\">&nbsp; 아래와 같이 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-weight: bold;\">흡연구역을 조정함을 알려드리오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt;\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">모든 구성원이 쾌적하고 건강한 환경에서 생활 할 수 있도록 적극적인 협조 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.3pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.3pt; margin-top: 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">조정 내역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">테크노관 동편 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">주차장 인근 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">흡연구역 폐쇄 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 99.8pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -99.8pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">조정 사유 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">해당 흡연구역이 연구실 등과 매우 인접하여 연기와 냄새가 실내로 유입</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">되어 구성원의 쾌적한 근무환경과 건강권 침해 호소  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.3pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">조정 시행 일자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">2025. 10. 22. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">시행 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.7pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -14.7pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.3pt; margin-right: 5pt; text-indent: -15.3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">교내 흡연구역 조정 안내문 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><div style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">※ 향후 도서관 문화복합시설 확충 완료 후 흡연구역 조정 예정이오니, 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
